{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "coupled_refresh_regrid",
    "description": "Shared offline fixture for the cross-language REFRESH-PATH conformance (CONFORMANCE_SPEC.md 5.10). A discretized, COUPLED, non-PDE model whose forcing is read from data sources at a discrete cadence and REGRIDDED from the source's coarse 6-cell native grid onto the 3-cell simulation grid -- IN-MODEL, as a coupling expression, not through a regrid seam. The 2:1 area-weighted coarsening is a const weight matrix `W[i,j]` (an in-file `const` observed): `F_tgt[j] = sum_i W[i,j]*F_src[i]`, `scale_tgt[j] = sum_i W[i,j]*scale_src[i]`. From 1.0.0 a data source is a registry entry, not a component: `F_src` and `scale_src` are PARAMETERS of M, each with `update: {kind: data, source: ...}` binding one of its file variables (esm-spec 8.5). `F_src` is DISCRETE -- its source `emis` declares a `temporal` block, so it refreshes at the hourly cadence anchors and the regridded `F_tgt` is a DISCRETE-materialized field (state-free but forcing-tainted). `scale_src` is CONST -- its source `factors` has no `temporal`, so it materializes once and the regridded `scale_tgt` is CONST-cadence. The coupled states integrate the regridded forcing: `D(c[j]) = scale_tgt[j]*F_tgt[j]` (the forced tracer) and `D(d[j]) = c[j]` (a dependent variable integrating the tracer across the cadence). The forcing is piecewise-constant across the cadence segments, so the regridded arrays and the integrated trajectory are closed-form and checkable to solver tolerance -- the analytic golden lives in golden/coupled_refresh_regrid.json. TWO-VIEW contract: the source-fed `F_src`/`scale_src` let the cadence classifier resolve them CONST/DISCRETE, while the typed array-simulate compiler resolves them through the forcing buffer refreshed at each cadence anchor. There is NO regrid seam / RegridApplier (removed as obsolete in v0.8.0): regridding is an ordinary in-model coupling contraction over the native forcing.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciAST/polecats/gastown.furiosa"
    ],
    "tags": [
      "refresh-path",
      "source-seeded",
      "data-source",
      "temporal",
      "discrete-variable",
      "regrid",
      "in-model-regrid",
      "conservative",
      "cadence",
      "coupled",
      "conformance"
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
    "emis": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "file:///data/emis/src_{date:%Y%m%d%H}.nc"
      },
      "temporal": {
        "frequency": "PT1H",
        "file_period": "P1D",
        "records_per_file": 24
      }
    },
    "factors": {
      "kind": "grid",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "file:///data/factors/scale.nc"
      }
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "M": {
      "variables": {
        "W": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "src_cells",
            "tgt_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Const conservative-regrid weight matrix W[i,j] (i=1..6 native source cells, j=1..3 sim target cells): the 2:1 area-weighted coarsening. Each target cell j averages its two source cells (W=0.5), so W is the in-model realization of the native->sim regrid. A build-once const observed."
        },
        "F_src": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "src_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-fed source read from the `emis` data source (WITH temporal): DISCRETE cadence, refreshed at each hourly anchor on the 6-cell native grid. Resolves through the forcing buffer in the typed RHS after the source-fed discrete strip.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "emis",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "surface_source"
            }
          },
          "units": "kg/s"
        },
        "scale_src": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "shape": [
            "src_cells"
          ],
          "description": "Source-fed scale factor read from the `factors` data source (NO temporal): CONST cadence, materialized once on the 6-cell native grid. Resolves through the forcing buffer in the typed RHS after the source-fed discrete strip.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
            "source": "factors",
            "from": {
              "file_variable": "scale_factor"
            }
          },
          "units": "1"
        },
        "F_tgt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "kg/s",
          "shape": [
            "tgt_cells"
          ],
          "description": "In-model regridded source on the 3-cell sim grid: F_tgt[j] = sum_i W[i,j]*F_src[i]. State-free but DISCRETE-forcing-tainted (reads F_src), so it materializes once per cadence refresh — the in-model regrid is the DISCRETE-materialized field."
        },
        "scale_tgt": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "tgt_cells"
          ],
          "description": "In-model regridded scale on the 3-cell sim grid: scale_tgt[j] = sum_i W[i,j]*scale_src[i]. Reads only const W and the CONST loader scale_src, so it is CONST-cadence (materialized once)."
        },
        "c": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "shape": [
            "tgt_cells"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Integrated tracer concentration on the sim grid — CONTINUOUS cadence (changes every step). D(c[j]) = scale_tgt[j]*F_tgt[j], the regridded forcing."
        },
        "d": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "shape": [
            "tgt_cells"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Integrated coupled tracer — CONTINUOUS. D(d[j]) = c[j]; a dependent variable integrating the forced tracer across the cadence, coupled to c."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "_comment": "D(c[j]) = scale_tgt[j]*F_tgt[j]. scale_tgt is CONST (const loader, materialized once); F_tgt is DISCRETE (temporal loader, refreshed per anchor). Both are in-model regrids of the 6-cell native fields onto j in [1,3]. Dense [1,3] ranges (not {from:<set>}) — index_sets are not yet carried through flatten.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "D",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "c",
                    "j"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "wrt": "t"
            }
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "scale_tgt",
                    "j"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "F_tgt",
                    "j"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "D(d[j]) = c[j]. The coupling: d integrates the forced tracer c.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "D",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "d",
                    "j"
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "wrt": "t"
            }
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "c",
                "j"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "W",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": [
              [
                0.5,
                0.0,
                0.0
              ],
              [
                0.5,
                0.0,
                0.0
              ],
              [
                0.0,
                0.5,
                0.0
              ],
              [
                0.0,
                0.5,
                0.0
              ],
              [
                0.0,
                0.0,
                0.5
              ],
              [
                0.0,
                0.0,
                0.5
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "F_tgt",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [
                1,
                6
              ],
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "args": [],
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "W",
                    "i",
                    "j"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "F_src",
                    "i"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "scale_tgt",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "j"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [
                1,
                6
              ],
              "j": [
                1,
                3
              ]
            },
            "args": [],
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "W",
                    "i",
                    "j"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "index",
                  "args": [
                    "scale_src",
                    "i"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
